- When you are doing an open ended search that may require multiple rounds of globbing and grepping, use the ${ht} tool instead (if available)`;function OMo(e,n,s){if($I({model:e,leanPrompt:n})){if(yW({model:e,leanRewrite:s}))return Qs;return`Content search built on ripgrep. Prefer this over \`grep\`/\`rg\` via ${We} \u2014 results integrate with the permission UI and file links.

- Full regex syntax (e.g. "log.*Error", "function\\s+\\w+"). Ripgrep, not grep \u2014 escape literal braces (\`interface\\{\\}\`).
- Filter with \`glob\` (e.g. "**/*.tsx") or \`type\` (e.g. "js", "py", "rust").
